{"route":{"id":"17267","name":"Rutes Geoparc. Gurp-Santa Engràcia","intro":"El tímid Gurp s'amaga sota les cingleres; altrament, la desinhibida Santa Engràcia s'exposa sobre del penyal i rep l'embat dels vents del nord. <strong>Els calorosos capvespres d'estiu, mentre el sol encara torra els \"llangardaixos\" (malnom dels habitants de Santa Engràcia), els \"bubons\" a Gurp gaudeixen de l'ombra de la serra.</strong> Però és a l'hivern quan el sol escalfa l'agosarada encimbellada davant la mirada gelosa del prudent llogarret.","tipus":"Circular horari","dificultat":"Difícil","durada":"5 hores","desnivell":"826.00 meters","distancia":"9.79 km","tema":"Geologia","imgs":["n17267_1.jpg","n17267_2.jpg","n17267_3.jpg","n17267_4.jpg"],"url":"https://naturalocal.net/ca/rutes-senderisme-catalunya/rutes-senderisme-lleida/rutes-senderisme-tremp/rutes-geoparc-gurp-santa-engracia","track":[[42.22519,0.8481],[42.2251,0.84806],[42.22495,0.84808],[42.22478,0.84804],[42.22461,0.84802],[42.22448,0.84798],[42.22436,0.84802],[42.22422,0.84809],[42.22409,0.84818],[42.22393,0.84819],[42.22388,0.84811],[42.22385,0.84799],[42.22385,0.84785],[42.22384,0.84774],[42.22387,0.84769],[42.22392,0.8476],[42.22393,0.84755],[42.22393,0.84755],[42.22399,0.84751],[42.22403,0.8474],[42.22406,0.84733],[42.22415,0.8473],[42.22412,0.84714],[42.22409,0.84701],[42.22405,0.84687],[42.22399,0.8467],[42.22392,0.84661],[42.22385,0.84648],[42.22398,0.84646],[42.2241,0.84647],[42.22423,0.84647],[42.22433,0.84645],[42.22433,0.84643],[42.22425,0.84638],[42.2242,0.84633],[42.22429,0.8463],[42.2244,0.84631],[42.22451,0.84635],[42.22459,0.84642],[42.22466,0.84641],[42.2246,0.84627],[42.22454,0.84618],[42.22445,0.8461],[42.22437,0.84603],[42.22428,0.84599],[42.22418,0.84596],[42.22411,0.84588],[42.22407,0.84579],[42.22404,0.84571],[42.22393,0.84565],[42.22383,0.84558],[42.2238,0.84551],[42.22376,0.84535],[42.22369,0.84525],[42.22367,0.84519],[42.22371,0.84517],[42.22372,0.84527],[42.2238,0.8454],[42.22381,0.84552],[42.22